\pard\sa60\sl240\slmult1\cf1\f0\fs18\lang9\b PRIVACY & NETWORK POLICY\b0\par
Your privacy is important to us. This policy explains what data YT Deluxe accesses, stores, and transmits.\par
\b 1. No Data Collection\b0\par
YT Deluxe does not collect, transmit, or store any personal data on remote servers. There are no user accounts, no sign-in requirements, no analytics, no telemetry, and no crash reporting. Your IP address is never logged by the application.\par
\b 2. Local Storage Only\b0\par
All user preferences, download history, and application settings are stored locally on your device. Nothing is synced to any cloud service or remote server. You have full control over your data and can delete it at any time by uninstalling the application or clearing the app data folder.\par
\b 3. Network Usage\b0\par
YT Deluxe connects to the internet solely for the following purposes:\par
\pard\li360\sa40\sl240\slmult1\bullet  \b YouTube Data Fetching:\b0  Video metadata, thumbnails, and streams are fetched via yt-dlp directly from YouTube. This data is processed locally on your device.\par
\bullet  \b Update Notifications:\b0  If enabled, the app checks the GitHub repository (github.com/Utsavstack/YT-Deluxe) for new version releases. This is a read-only API call and sends no user data.\par
\bullet  \b No Third-Party Requests:\b0  No data is sent to any third-party analytics, advertising, or tracking service.\par
\pard\sa60\sl240\slmult1\b 4. Third-Party Services\b0\par
When you search for or download content, YouTube/Google's own Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. YT Deluxe acts as a local client and does not modify or intercept YouTube's data handling practices.\par
\b 5. Cookies & Tracking\b0\par
YT Deluxe does not set, read, or use cookies. The application does not use browser fingerprinting, device identifiers, or any other tracking mechanism.\par
\b 6. Children's Privacy\b0\par
This software is intended for users aged 13 and above. We do not knowingly collect any information from children under this age.\par
\b 7. Changes to This Policy\b0\par
This privacy policy may be updated with new releases. Significant changes will be noted in the release changelog on GitHub.\par
\pard\sa40\sl240\slmult1\fs16 Full privacy policy at: github.com/Utsavstack/YT-Deluxe\par
